desc(
	title: "Detect JPA LIKE Wildcard Without Escape"
	title_zh: "检测JPA LIKE通配符未转义"
	type: vuln
	risk: "查询语义越界"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 漏洞描述
本规则检测 JPA Query-by-Example 或类似查询构造逻辑中，直接把用户值拼进 `LIKE` 模式串而不做 wildcard 转义的实现。

常见危险形态包括：
- `"%" + value + "%"`
- `value + "%"`
- `"%" + value`

如果输入中的 `%`、`_` 等通配符没有被显式 escape，攻击者就可能扩大匹配范围，导致超出预期的数据返回。
DESC
	rule_id: "3cf3b820-f0bf-45b1-b9b6-8b68f221583a"
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
- 对进入 `LIKE` 查询的用户值统一调用 escape 逻辑，而不是直接拼 `%`。
- 将 escape 字符作为显式参数传给 `cb.like(...)` 或对应查询 API。
- 不要把 wildcard 语义直接暴露给外部输入；需要模糊匹配时，先做字符转义再拼接前后缀。
SOLUTION
	reference: <<<REFERENCE
[CWE-89: Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/89.html)
REFERENCE
)

getStringMatcherForPath(* as $matcherArg) as $matcherCall;
like(*<slice(index=2)>?{have:'%'} as $likePatternArg) as $likeCall;
escape(* as $escapeArg) as $escapeCall;

$matcherCall<getFunc> as $matcherFunc;
$likeCall<getFunc> as $likeFunc;
$escapeCall<getFunc> as $escapeFunc;

$likeFunc?{<self> & $matcherFunc} as $candidateFunc;
$candidateFunc - $escapeFunc as $unguardedFunc;
$likeCall?{<getFunc> & $unguardedFunc} as $risk;

alert $risk for {
	title: "Detect JPA LIKE Wildcard Without Escape",
	title_zh: "检测JPA LIKE通配符未转义",
	level: "middle",
	message: "发现 JPA LIKE 模式串直接拼接 wildcard 与用户值，且当前函数内未看到显式的 escape 调用。",
	risk: "查询语义越界",
	name: "risk",
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
本规则用于审计 Query-by-Example / Criteria 查询构造中，`LIKE` 模式串直接拼接 `%` 与用户值的实现。

如果同一函数内没有看到类似 `escapeCharacter.escape(...)` 的转义步骤，输入中的 `%`、`_` 等通配符就可能扩大匹配范围，导致超出预期的数据返回。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 审计建议
- 在拼接 `%` 前先对用户值执行 wildcard escape。
- 对 `CONTAINING` / `STARTING` / `ENDING` 这类模糊匹配策略单独做输入转义。
- 将 escape 字符和 escape 逻辑作为统一的查询构造基础设施，而不是每处分散实现。
SOLUTION
}

desc(
	lang: java
	alert_min: 1
	'file://risk.java': <<<CODE
class QueryByExamplePredicateBuilderRisk {
    void addLike(CriteriaBuilder cb, Expression expression, Object attributeValue, ExampleMatcherAccessor exampleAccessor, String currentPath) {
        switch (exampleAccessor.getStringMatcherForPath(currentPath)) {
            case CONTAINING:
                cb.like(expression, "%" + attributeValue + "%");
                break;
            case STARTING:
                cb.like(expression, attributeValue + "%");
                break;
            case ENDING:
                cb.like(expression, "%" + attributeValue);
                break;
            default:
                break;
        }
    }
}

interface CriteriaBuilder {
    void like(Object expression, Object pattern);
}

interface Expression {}

interface ExampleMatcherAccessor {
    String getStringMatcherForPath(String currentPath);
}
CODE
	'safefile://safe.java': <<<CODE
class QueryByExamplePredicateBuilderSafe {
    void addLike(CriteriaBuilder cb, Expression expression, Object attributeValue, ExampleMatcherAccessor exampleAccessor, String currentPath, EscapeCharacter escapeCharacter) {
        switch (exampleAccessor.getStringMatcherForPath(currentPath)) {
            case CONTAINING:
                cb.like(expression, "%" + escapeCharacter.escape(attributeValue.toString()) + "%", escapeCharacter.getEscapeCharacter());
                break;
            case STARTING:
                cb.like(expression, escapeCharacter.escape(attributeValue.toString()) + "%", escapeCharacter.getEscapeCharacter());
                break;
            case ENDING:
                cb.like(expression, "%" + escapeCharacter.escape(attributeValue.toString()), escapeCharacter.getEscapeCharacter());
                break;
            default:
                break;
        }
    }
}

interface CriteriaBuilder {
    void like(Object expression, Object pattern, Object escapeChar);
}

interface Expression {}

interface ExampleMatcherAccessor {
    String getStringMatcherForPath(String currentPath);
}

interface EscapeCharacter {
    String escape(String value);
    Object getEscapeCharacter();
}
CODE
)
